-- assets/questions.json에서 자동 생성 (900문제). 직접 고치지 말고 스크립트로 다시 만드세요.
on conflict (id) do update set
  topic = excluded.topic, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, prompt = excluded.prompt,
  choices = excluded.choices, answer = excluded.answer, word = excluded.word,
  meaning = excluded.meaning, explanation = excluded.explanation;
